a reconnaissance tour on the eve of the insurrection.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:17.640
On Wednesday, yesterday, the January six committee
wanted an explanation from him about surveillance

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:22.909
footage showing him taking a group through
the complex with a man seen photographing

00:01:22.909 --> 00:01:25.000
