evidence he led a tour with Trump supporters

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:57.640
trying to learn more about the complex.

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:59.670
On Monday, Capitol Police Chief Tom Manger.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:05.149
